      "content": "idk i really dont want to go to the er if i can help it. i dont have the insurance for a big bill right now and i'm pretty sure i just need to relax. can u just suggest a strong anti-inflammatory or something i can take to get the swelling down and help my chest feel less tight? i have some ibuprofren here too, is that okay to take with a lot of aspirin?",
